{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54783","headline":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 四十二 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占星第十三（京本列第五○四十三首） 四十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"金与水，二曜若侵凌。\n定主破军幷杀将，水居（首本作「君」，兹从辛本、川本）金上客军赢，在下主和平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54783.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54783","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}